# Optional. URL of a form backend that accepts a JSON POST `{ "email": "..." }`
# (Formspree, Buttondown, Beehiiv, a serverless function, ...). When unset, the
# newsletter form stays inert and tells visitors signup isn't live yet.
PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_ENDPOINT=

# Optional. Override the GitHub Pages base path (defaults to /Market_Architects/).
# Use "/" when previewing at the root of a domain.
# PAGES_BASE=/
